(CMSA) of Harvard University. C.P. is supported by an NSF CAREER Award (IIS-2239780), DARPA grants DIAL-FP-038 and AIQ-HR00112520041, the Simons Collaboration on the Physics of Learning and Neural Computation, and the William F. Milton Fund from Harvard University. This work has been made possible in part by a gift from the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative Foundation to establish the Kempner Institute for the Study of Natural and Artificial Intelligence.</p>
</div>
</section>
